OL,3,GNEWSA'Cheese grater' bridge ramps      
OL,4,Aaltered after dogs hurt                
OL,6,FA council is set to alter accessibility
OL,7,Framps on a newly reopened footbridge   
OL,8,Fafter reports its surface was injuring 
OL,9,Fdogs' paws.                            
OL,11,FDerby City Council said it had received
OL,12,Freports of dogs being injured while    
OL,13,Fusing Walter's Walkway, which replaced 
OL,14,Fthe former Darley Abbey Mills Bridge   
OL,15,Fand reopened on 13 November after being
OL,16,Fclosed since December last year.       
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
