OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSA'Cheese grater' bridge ramps      
OL,4,Aaltered after dogs hurt                
OL,6,FAt a full council meeting on Tuesday,  
OL,7,FConservative councillor for Mickleover 
OL,8,F- Miles Pattison - told of the bridge's
OL,9,Faccessibility ramps being dubbed a     
OL,10,F"cheese grater", and said that dogs'   
OL,11,Fclaws had been "ripped out".           
OL,13,FThe authority said it would now install
OL,14,Fa 50cm-wide non-slip strip alongside   
OL,15,Feach ramp by "early December" to       
OL,16,Fresolve the issue.                     
